<title>USA: Money Store names Benoff CFO.</title>
<headline>Money Store names Benoff CFO.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Money Store Inc said on Friday that Michael Benoff, senior vice president, will assume the duties of chief financial officer and that Morton Dear, chief financial officer, will become vice chairman. The changes are expected to be effective by September 1.</p>
<p>Dear has been executive vice president, chief financial officer, secretary and director of the company since 1983, and for the past 24 years has been primarily responsible for the financial affairs of the company.</p>
<p>Michael Benoff has been a senior vice president of the company since 1994.</p>
